### Update GlesRenderer GL Context Management

Source: https://developer.android.com/jetpack/androidx/releases/wear_hl=bn

In `GlesRenderer`, `onGlContextCreated` is renamed to `onBackgroundThreadGlContextCreated`, and `onGlSurfaceCreated` to `onUiThreadGlSurfaceCreated`. This clarifies the thread on which these GL-related callbacks occur, improving understanding of GL lifecycle management within the renderer.

```java
public class GlesRenderer {

    /**
     * Called on the background thread when the GL context is created.
     * Use this for background thread GL initializations.
     */
    protected void onBackgroundThreadGlContextCreated() {
        // Background thread GL context setup
    }

    /**
     * Called on the UI thread when the GL surface is created.
     * Use this for UI thread GL surface setup.
     */
    protected void onUiThreadGlSurfaceCreated() {
        // UI thread GL surface setup
    }

    // Deprecated methods (example):
    // @Deprecated
    // protected void onGlContextCreated() { /* ... */ }
    // @Deprecated
    // protected void onGlSurfaceCreated() { /* ... */ }
}

```

